{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/init(ratio:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV5ratioACSd_tcfc","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(ratio:)","symbolKind":"init","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"ratio","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The contrast ratio to use","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines a WCAG 2.1 ratio with the given contrast ratio value"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/init(ratio:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"title":"Foundations","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher level targets."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_layers.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"},"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9